# ── Secrets: NEVER commit service-account keys / credentials ─────────────────
# The Google TTS key must live OUTSIDE the repo (point SYNAPSE_GOOGLE_TTS_CREDENTIALS
# at an external path). These rules are a safety net in case one lands under inference/.
*.sa.json
service-account*.json
*service-account*.json
*-credentials.json
*credentials*.json
gcp-*.json
.secrets/
secrets/
*.pem
*.key

# TTS monthly char-budget counter (runtime state, machine-local)
tts_char_budget.json

# Local SQLite chat store (runtime state)
synapse_chats.db
synapse_chats.db-*

# ── Model weights — large third-party binaries, live locally only ────────────
# (The repo's stated policy is that models are gitignored. Whisper .bin + the dead
#  XTTS .pth weights were tracked historically — new adds are blocked here; removing
#  the existing blobs from history is a destructive git filter-repo → OWNER.)
models/
*.bin
*.pth
*.pt
*.gguf
*.onnx
